              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "AddressSanitizer reported a heap-buffer-overflow at a fuzz-reachable site. Out-of-bounds writes lead to remote code execution and out-of-bounds reads to information disclosure."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "AddressSanitizer reported a heap-buffer-overflow at a fuzz-reachable site. Out-of-bounds writes lead to remote code execution and out-of-bounds reads to information disclosure.\n\n**References:**\n\n- https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/787.html\n- https://cwe.mitre.org/top25/\n- https://cwe.mitre.org/top25/archive/2024/2024_cwe_top25.html\n- https://github.com/google/sanitizers/wiki/AddressSanitizer\n",
                "text": "AddressSanitizer reported a heap-buffer-overflow at a fuzz-reachable site. Out-of-bounds writes lead to remote code execution and out-of-bounds reads to information disclosure.\n\nReferences:\n- https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/787.html\n- https://cwe.mitre.org/top25/\n- https://cwe.mitre.org/top25/archive/2024/2024_cwe_top25.html\n- https://github.com/google/sanitizers/wiki/AddressSanitizer\n"
